 app.innerHTML=`${a.warmup?warmupBar():''}<div class="eyebrow">${a.warmup?`${esc(ptName(a.wsec||'operating'))} · step ${a.wstep||''} of 5`:`Extra round · ${SECTION_TITLE[sc.section]} · ${a.level===1?'easier':a.level===2?'test-like':'harder'}`}</div><h1 style="font-size:2.2rem">${esc(sc.company)}: ${a.worked?'one '+sc.section+' section, built for you':'build the '+sc.section+' section'}</h1>${a.worked?`<div class="notice"><b>Read this one, don’t fill it.</b> Every line is answered, with the reason under it in green. Click <b>theory</b> on any line for the lesson that teaches it, or <b>practice</b> for a short set on just that idea; a Back to Test Prep button brings you back here.</div>`:''}<p class="muted">${a.worked?'The steps are listed on the Test Prep page under “How to build it.”':'Use the company documents (income statement, balance sheet, additional information).'} For each item decide: not in this section, or in it with a direction and amount. Then enter the total. ${a.section==='operating'?'Start with net income.':''}</p><p class="one-line"><b>The whole idea:</b> ${esc(sc.section==='operating'?PREP_ONE_LINE:sc.section==='investing'?'Investing does not start from net income. It lists the actual cash paid to buy long-term assets and the actual cash received from selling them. One line per deal.':'Financing lists the actual cash that came in from lenders and owners and the actual cash that went back out to them.')}</p><details class="prep-how" ${a.level===1||a.worked?'open':''}><summary><b>The steps</b> · keep these in view while you build</summary><ol class="small">${PREP_PROCEDURE[sc.section].map(s=>`<li>${esc(s)}</li>`).join('')}</ol></details><div class="prep-grid"><div class="prep-docs">${docs}</div><div class="prep-build card"><div class="statement-head"><strong>${esc(sc.company)}</strong><span>Statement of Cash Flows (partial)</span><span>Cash flows from ${sc.section} activities</span></div><form id="prep-form">${sc.blank?blankFormHTML(sc,a,g):`<table class="prep-table"><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>In this section?</th><th>Amount</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>${sc.start?`<tr class="${g?(g.startOK?'ok':'bad'):''}"><td><b>${esc(sc.start.label)}</b>${a.showWhere?'<br><small class="muted">Income statement, bottom line</small>':''}</td><td><small class="muted">always first</small></td><td><input name="start" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="amount" value="${esc(String(a.draft.__start||''))}" ${g?'disabled':''}></td><td class="mark">${g?(g.startOK?'✓':'✗'):''}</td></tr>`:''}${sc.items.map(row).join('')}<tr class="total ${g?(g.totalOK?'ok':'bad'):''}"><td colspan="2"><b>${esc(totalLabel(sc.section))}</b><br><small class="muted">use a minus sign or parentheses if cash went out</small></td><td><input name="total" placeholder="total" value="${esc(String(a.draft.__total||''))}" ${g?'disabled':''}></td><td class="mark">${g?(g.totalOK?'✓':'✗'):''}</td></tr></tbody></table>`}<div class="row" style="flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">${g?'':'<button class="primary" type="submit">Check my section</button>'}${!g&&a.warmup?'<button type="button" class="link" id="warm-skip" title="Move to the next step without checking this one">Skip this step →</button>':''}${sc.blank?'':`<label class="small"><input type="checkbox" id="prep-where" ${a.showWhere?'checked':''}> show where each number comes from</label>`}</div></form>${g?`<div class="prep-result"><h3>${a.worked?'Worked example, all lines shown':g.score+' of '+g.max+' right'}${a.worked?'':g.score===g.max?' · that is a full-credit section':g.score>=g.max*0.7?' · close; fix the ✗ lines':' · look at the reasons, then try the same numbers again'}</h3>${a.worked?'':g.totalOK&&!g.totalKey?`<p class="small">Your total adds up your own lines correctly, so it earns the total point (the same carry-forward rule as the paper test). The key’s total is ${esc(String(sc.total))} because of the ✗ line${g.rows.filter(r=>!r.ok).length>1?'s':''} above.</p>`:g.totalOK?'':`<p class="small">Your total: ${esc(String(g.totalGiven))}. The key’s total is ${esc(String(sc.total))}, and your own lines add to ${esc(String(g.own))}. ${g.rows.every(r=>r.ok)&&g.startOK?'Every line is right, so recheck the arithmetic.':'Fix the ✗ lines, then re-add.'}</p>`}<div class="row" style="flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px">${a.warmup?`<button class="primary" id="warm-next">Next step →</button>${a.worked?'':'<button id="prep-retry">Try again, same numbers</button>'}`:a.worked?`<button class="primary" id="prep-new">Now try one yourself (Level 1) →</button>`:`<button id="prep-retry">Try again, same numbers</button><button class="primary" id="prep-new">New numbers, same level</button>`}<button id="prep-answer">${a.showAnswer?'Hide':'Show'} the worked answer</button><button id="prep-exit">Back to Test Prep</button></div>${a.showAnswer?`<div class="statement" style="margin-top:12px">${answerStatementHTML(sc)}</div>`:''}</div>`:''}</div></div>`;
